00:16:07,500 --> 00:16:13,500
The history of New York’s Meatpacking District, told from the perspective
of transgender sex workers who lived and worked there.

4
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Filmmaker Kristen Lovell, who walked “The Stroll” for a decade, reunites her community to recount the violence,
policing, homelessness, and gentrification they overcame to build a movement for transgender rights.

