00:59:07,500 --> 00:59:13,500
The Stroll is a 2023 American documentary film, directed
by Kristen Lovell and Zackary Drucker.

12
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
The film documents trans history in New York City, from the perspective of Black and Latina trans women who had been
sex workers in the Meatpacking District during the 1980s and 1990s, in an area known as The Stroll.

13
01:09:52,500 --> 01:09:58,500
The film had its world premiere at the 2023 Sundance Film Festival on January
23, 2023 and won a special jury prize for clarity of vision.

14
01:15:15,000 --> 01:15:21,000
HBO released the film on June 21, 2023.

